OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber                     
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy and grey start  
OL,6,Fto Thursday, but with perhaps the odd  
OL,7,Fbrighter spell developing through the  
OL,8,Fafternoon. Chilly with a brisk wind,   
OL,9,Fespecially towards the coast.          
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy and largely dry        
OL,12,Fovernight with an increasing           
OL,13,Fsoutheasterly wind. Chance of the odd  
OL,14,Fspot of rain arriving into the far     
OL,15,Fnorth by dawn. Cold with a patchy      
OL,16,Ffrost developing.                      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
